# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║  STOA LINUX — Sync manifest                                 ║
# ║  Read by `stoa-sync` (alias `sync-stoa`).                   ║
# ║                                                              ║
# ║  One path per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.       ║
# ║  `~` and `$VAR` are expanded. Both files and directories OK. ║
# ║                                                              ║
# ║  Each listed path is mirrored into the repo at               ║
# ║  dotfiles/<path-relative-to-$HOME>. Already-symlinked files  ║
# ║  (kitty, hyprland, rofi, eww, waybar, etc.) are caught by    ║
# ║  `git add -A` automatically — don't add them here.           ║
# ║                                                              ║
# ║  Uncomment what you want versioned. Heads up: some of these  ║
# ║  may contain tokens or personal IDs — sanitize before        ║
# ║  publishing.                                                 ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

# ── Shell rcs (only your personal additions live here; the bulk
#    comes from sourcing shell/.{bash,zsh}rc) ──
# ~/.zshrc
# ~/.bashrc

# ── Git ──
# ~/.gitconfig

# ── SSH (config only — never list the private keys) ──
# ~/.ssh/config

# ── VS Code (settings.json is already Stoa-symlinked) ──
# ~/.config/Code/User/keybindings.json
# ~/.config/Code/User/snippets

# ── Tmux ──
# ~/.tmux.conf

# ── Obsidian app preferences (NOT the vault data) ──
# ~/.config/obsidian/obsidian.json

# ── Discord (skip — large, has tokens/cache) ──

# ── Brave (skip — browser profile, has cookies/tokens) ──
